{"id": "EUVD-2026-98953", "enisaUuid": "5e91351a-e4ad-3ba1-86ca-ce7106ef953e", "description": "PickMall lilishop through 4.4 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows authenticated sellers to change other stores' product freight templates via PUT /store/goods/goods/freight. GoodsServiceImpl.freight and GoodsSkuServiceImpl.freight update goods and SKUs by id without store-scoped checks, letting sellers bind their own templates to competitors' products and alter shipping charges.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:53:17", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/lilishop-seller-goods-cross-store-authz-bypass", "https://github.com/lilishop/lilishop/blob/v4.4/framework/src/main/java/cn/lili/modules/goods/serviceimpl/GoodsServiceImpl.java#L424-L442", "https://github.com/lilishop/lilishop/blob/v4.4/seller-api/src/main/java/cn/lili/controller/goods/GoodsStoreController.java#L177-L185", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/pickmall-lilishop-through-4.4-idor-via-goods-freight-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110122", "GHSA-jvm3-xfv6-2qc6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "987179e9-b3d9-3a1c-afab-76213ff7377b", "product": {"name": "lilishop", "vendor": {"name": "PickMall"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "51025ba4-98f1-3caa-93a1-cb65cefc687e", "vendor": {"name": "PickMall"}}], "isExploited": false}